
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
Availability                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Capabilities                       	N/A                 	N/A       
CapabilityDescriptions             	N/A                 	N/A       
Compression                        	N/A                 	N/A       
CompressionMethod                  	N/A                 	N/A       
ConfigManagerErrorCode             	N/A                 	N/A       
ConfigManagerUserConfig            	N/A                 	N/A       
DefaultBlockSize                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
DeviceID                           	N/A                 	N/A       
ECC                                	N/A                 	N/A       
EOTWarningZoneSize                 	N/A                 	N/A       
ErrorCleared                       	N/A                 	N/A       
ErrorDescription                   	N/A                 	N/A       
ErrorMethodology                   	N/A                 	N/A       
FeaturesHigh                       	N/A                 	N/A       
FeaturesLow                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Id                                 	N/A                 	N/A       
InstallDate                        	N/A                 	N/A       
LastErrorCode                      	N/A                 	N/A       
Manufacturer                       	N/A                 	N/A       
MaxBlockSize                       	N/A                 	N/A       
MaxMediaSize                       	N/A                 	N/A       
MaxPartitionCount                  	N/A                 	N/A       
MediaType                          	N/A                 	N/A       
MinBlockSize                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
NeedsCleaning                      	N/A                 	N/A       
NumberOfMediaSupported             	N/A                 	N/A       
PNPDeviceID                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Padding                            	N/A                 	N/A       
PowerManagementCapabilities        	N/A                 	N/A       
PowerManagementSupported           	N/A                 	N/A       
ReportSetMarks                     	N/A                 	N/A       
Status                             	N/A                 	N/A       
StatusInfo                         	N/A                 	N/A       

